  "description": "Teammachine SLR 01 ONE is peak BMC: the ultimate carbon climbing bike with minimal weight, next-level power transfer, advanced aerodynamics, and a ride feel shaped in our Impec Lab to be lighter, sharper, and faster than ever.\nIts ultra-light 01 Premium Carbon frame brings ruthless power transfer uphill with an uncompromisingly low weight and the sharpest handling on the way down. Evolved aerodynamics across the frame unlock free speed – bringing our most advanced lightweight road bike closer than ever to the Teammachine R 01 in outright aerodynamic performance.\nWith TCC Race compliance and wickedly precise handling, it carries the unmistakable BMC character across changing gradients, making it comfortable on rough roads and controlled in the corners.\nAdd the SRAM RED AXS drivetrain with power meter, the next-gen ICS Carbon Aero cockpit, and DT Swiss ARC 1100 DICUT 38 mm wheels, and you complete a build made to defy gravity.",
